1
00:00:00,090 --> 00:00:01,675
An AI can give you an answer.

2
00:00:02,088 --> 00:00:04,111
EvidenceDoc lets you interrogate it.

3
00:00:04,562 --> 00:00:07,668
Here is a real document, and every step from

4
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,562
a claim back to its source.

5
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:13,556
Start with NVIDIA's original earnings report.

6
00:00:13,956 --> 00:00:19,033
Nemotron reads the document, identifies useful entities, and suggests

7
00:00:19,046 --> 00:00:22,487
an extraction schema. The source appears while the analysis

8
00:00:22,629 --> 00:00:23,479
is still running.

9
00:00:24,763 --> 00:00:30,446
People, organizations, dates, and amounts become searchable, source-linked
entities.

10
00:00:30,833 --> 00:00:33,436
Select a value and the reader opens the right

11
00:00:33,436 --> 00:00:37,237
page, zooms in, and centers the cited occurrence.

12
00:00:38,562 --> 00:00:41,332
For a financial review, we can also request a

13
00:00:41,345 --> 00:00:43,021
consistent set of fields.

14
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,402
Revenue, earnings per share, and payment dates remain connected

15
00:00:47,402 --> 00:00:48,626
to their supporting text.

16
00:00:49,051 --> 00:00:51,397
The document stays one click away.

17
00:00:52,663 --> 00:00:55,691
When the report does not identify an external auditor,

18
00:00:56,065 --> 00:00:58,462
the system returns no supported value.

19
00:00:58,874 --> 00:01:02,032
It does not turn general knowledge into document evidence.

20
00:01:02,444 --> 00:01:06,065
The activity log makes the review trace inspectable.

21
00:01:07,333 --> 00:01:10,825
The evidence graph shows how entities connect to source

22
00:01:10,838 --> 00:01:15,658
pages. Filter to recurring entities, select a node, inspect

23
00:01:15,671 --> 00:01:18,931
its quoted context, and jump back into the document.

24
00:01:19,356 --> 00:01:22,965
These are source connections, not invented business relationships.

25
00:01:24,233 --> 00:01:27,880
Now compare two real reporting periods using the same

26
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:32,828
fields. Quarterly revenue changes from fifty-seven billion to sixty-eight

27
00:01:32,841 --> 00:01:34,504
point one billion dollars.

28
00:01:34,942 --> 00:01:37,455
The dividend stays at one cent per share.

29
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:41,437
Every change can be checked against both original documents.

30
00:01:42,723 --> 00:01:45,172
The most revealing test is subtraction.

31
00:01:45,584 --> 00:01:48,986
Select the dividend payment date and withhold its cited

32
00:01:48,986 --> 00:01:50,532
regions from a separate copy.

33
00:01:50,945 --> 00:01:55,288
EvidenceDoc removes the matching text and image regions, then

34
00:01:55,404 --> 00:01:58,277
asks the model again without its previous answer.

35
00:01:59,583 --> 00:02:03,140
The original answer was April first, twenty twenty-six.

36
00:02:03,565 --> 00:02:07,109
With that evidence withheld, this run returns no supported

37
00:02:07,109 --> 00:02:10,988
value. That demonstrates dependence on the selected evidence.

38
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,913
It is an experiment you can inspect, not a

39
00:02:13,913 --> 00:02:16,014
blanket guarantee of correctness.

40
00:02:17,316 --> 00:02:19,958
The workflow also handles scanned documents.

41
00:02:20,370 --> 00:02:24,313
This original World Bank grant agreement uses Nemotron Super

42
00:02:24,584 --> 00:02:27,767
alongside a Nemotron Omni visual retry.

43
00:02:28,166 --> 00:02:31,066
Open the grant amount and inspect the supporting region

44
00:02:31,195 --> 00:02:32,213
on the scanned page.

45
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,851
Export the structured evidence for another workflow.

46
00:02:37,263 --> 00:02:41,593
Values travel with their source references, bounding boxes, review

47
00:02:41,606 --> 00:02:43,577
status, and model trace.

48
00:02:44,003 --> 00:02:48,152
This demo uses original public PDFs and actual NVIDIA

49
00:02:48,165 --> 00:02:49,273
model responses.

50
00:02:50,563 --> 00:02:52,908
EvidenceDoc. Discover what matters.

51
00:02:53,321 --> 00:02:56,568
Inspect every claim. Test what the answer depends on.

52
00:02:56,994 --> 00:02:58,566
Built with NVIDIA Nemotron.

53
00:02:58,965 --> 00:03:01,414
Explore the project and try it on a document

54
00:03:01,427 --> 00:03:01,865
of your own.
